# <<< loom-managed <<<

# hbt-mismatch-pair (issue #186): raw per-unit klt artifact trees are
# re-creatable scratch -- the committed evidence is the reports, the compact
# per-sample JSON and the kept sample logs under probe-logs/<id>/.
sim/hbt-mismatch-pair/probe-logs/*/out_*/

# Stored evidence (issue #226): sim/harness/cli.py stages a run's raw outputs
# (per-point logs, frozen snapshots) here before `klt artifact put`. Scratch,
# never committed; only manifests/artifacts/*.manifest.json and the record are.
sim/.work/
